# values for `script/deploy.sh mainnet`. docs/RUNBOOK.md section 1. no secret goes into this file.
#   LAUNCH_CONFIG  the launch copy of script/config/mainnet.json (RUNBOOK step 1), gitignored
#   DEPLOYER       the v2 factory owner, the config owner and the signer
#   RPC_URL        read rpc, archive capable; RPC_URL in the shell overrides it
#   SEND_RPC_VAR   name of the shell variable that holds the private relay url the broadcast goes through
#   KEYSTORE_ACCOUNT, PASSWORD_FILE  the foundry keystore name (~/.foundry/keystores) and a password file outside the
#                  repository; left empty here, the shell supplies them (a frozen checkout takes no edit). the wrapper
#                  refuses while either is empty
#   VERIFY         etherscan verification after the record is written; ETHERSCAN_API_KEY comes from the shell
#   GIT_GUARD      clean tree, branch main, every row of the freeze table ok
#   SIGNOFF        CONFIG_HASH from the shell must equal the hash preflight prints for LAUNCH_CONFIG
NODE=live
CHAIN_ID=1
RPC_URL=https://gateway.tenderly.co/public/mainnet
LAUNCH_CONFIG=script/config/local.json
DEPLOYER=0xCB43078C32423F5348Cab5885911C3B5faE217F9
WALLET=keystore
KEYSTORE_ACCOUNT=
PASSWORD_FILE=
SEND_RPC_VAR=PRIVATE_RPC
VERIFY=1
GIT_GUARD=1
SIGNOFF=1
